{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"Bad weather on Sunday afternoon. — Because I overlooked the note on the theater program: “Start exceptionally /67 o’clock,” I only went at 7 o’clock and just missed the main thing: the chorus “Long live our good Emperor Franz”; — then the first act of Zelmira, how Dardanelli sang divinely! and above all Donzelli a recitative, which was his triumph! in opera seria he is unsurpassed, — he and Lablache — bearded with black curls, what antique heads!"}}],"created":1795219028,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":112,"prompt_tokens":191,"total_tokens":303,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-8LFTRPIelv9AnVY3rpvEBC5G3zPYICy7","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":191,"prompt_ms":385.369,"prompt_per_token_ms":2.0176387434554974,"prompt_per_second":495.6288648023063,"predicted_n":112,"predicted_ms":2630.806,"predicted_per_token_ms":23.700954954954955,"predicted_per_second":42.19239274959841}}